{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "luggage-delivery",
  "revision": 1,
  "access": "lifetime",
  "title": {
    "zh-Hant": "寄送行李到機場",
    "zh-Hans": "寄送行李到机场",
    "en": "Sending luggage to the airport"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh-Hant": "寄行李到機場時櫃台會問的六件事",
    "zh-Hans": "寄行李到机场时柜台会问的六件事",
    "en": "Six things the counter asks when you send bags to the airport"
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "luggage-delivery.count",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台問要寄幾件",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂柜台问要寄几件",
        "en": "Understand when you are asked how many bags to send"
      },
      "phrasings": [
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.count.p1",
          "role": "first",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "お荷物は何個お送りしますか？",
          "voice": "Aoede",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.count.p1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.count.p2",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "何個口ですか？",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.count.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.count.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "お送りするのは全部で何点ですか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.count.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要寄到哪裡",
            "zh-Hans": "要寄到哪里",
            "en": "Where to send them"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要寄幾件",
            "zh-Hans": "要寄几件",
            "en": "How many bags to send"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "行李有多重",
            "zh-Hans": "行李有多重",
            "en": "How heavy the bags are"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "2つです",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.count.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「何個」「何点」都是問幾件，「個口」是宅配算件數的說法。說「2つです」，或用手指比。",
        "zh-Hans": "「何個」「何点」都是问几件，「個口」是快递算件数的说法。说「2つです」，或用手指比。",
        "en": "何個 and 何点 both ask how many. 個口 is the word couriers use to count parcels. Say 2つです, or show it with your fingers."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "suitcase"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "luggage-delivery.contents",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台問有沒有貴重品或易碎物",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂柜台问有没有贵重品或易碎物",
        "en": "Understand when you are asked about valuables or fragile items"
      },
      "phrasings": [
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.contents.p1",
          "role": "first",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "貴重品や割れ物は入っていませんか？",
          "voice": "Aoede",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.contents.p1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.contents.p2",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "壊れ物や貴重品、入っていませんよね？",
          "voice": "Charon",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.contents.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.contents.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "パソコンや現金、割れ物などは入っていませんか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.contents.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "有沒有貴重品或易碎物",
            "zh-Hans": "有没有贵重品或易碎物",
            "en": "Any valuables or fragile items"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "行李有沒有上鎖",
            "zh-Hans": "行李有没有上锁",
            "en": "Is your bag locked"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "裡面裝了什麼衣服",
            "zh-Hans": "里面装了什么衣服",
            "en": "What clothes are inside"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "入っていません",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.contents.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「貴重品」是現金、電腦這類東西，「割れ物」「壊れ物」是易碎物。這是否定問句，回「はい」是「對，沒有」，直接說「入っていません」。電池、噴霧罐等也可能不能寄，依業者規定不同，以現場說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "「貴重品」是现金、电脑这类东西，「割れ物」「壊れ物」是易碎物。这是否定问句，回「はい」是「对，没有」，直接说「入っていません」。电池、喷雾罐等也可能不能寄，依快递公司规定不同，以现场说明为准。",
        "en": "貴重品 means valuables like cash or a laptop, and 割れ物 or 壊れ物 means fragile items. This is a negative question, so はい means yes, there are none. Say 入っていません. Batteries and sprays may not be accepted either; rules differ by company, so follow what the staff tell you."
      },
      "wordIds": [],
      "reviewNote": "Courier rules on valuables, batteries and sprays for airport delivery differ by company; check the explanation with someone who knows current practice."
    },
    {
      "id": "luggage-delivery.airport",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台問要寄到哪個機場",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂柜台问要寄到哪个机场",
        "en": "Understand when you are asked which airport"
      },
      "phrasings": [
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.airport.p1",
          "role": "first",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "どちらの空港をご利用ですか？",
          "voice": "Aoede",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.airport.p1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.airport.p2",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "ご出発の空港はどちらですか？",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.airport.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.airport.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "成田と羽田、どちらでしょうか？",
          "voice": "Charon",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.airport.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要從哪個航廈出發",
            "zh-Hans": "要从哪个航站楼出发",
            "en": "Which terminal you leave from"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "哪天出發",
            "zh-Hans": "哪天出发",
            "en": "Which day you leave"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要寄到哪個機場",
            "zh-Hans": "要寄到哪个机场",
            "en": "Which airport to send it to"
          },
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "成田です",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.airport.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「空港」是機場，「ご出発」是出發。說機場名加「です」，例如「成田です」「羽田です」「関空です」。寄到飯店的話，這裡會改問飯店名稱。",
        "zh-Hans": "「空港」是机场，「ご出発」是出发。说机场名加「です」，例如「成田です」「羽田です」「関空です」。寄到酒店的话，这里会改问酒店名称。",
        "en": "空港 is airport and ご出発 is departure. Say the airport name with です, like 成田です, 羽田です or 関空です. If you are sending to a hotel, they ask for the hotel name here instead."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "airport-terminal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "luggage-delivery.date",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台問哪天出發",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂柜台问哪天出发",
        "en": "Understand when you are asked your departure date"
      },
      "phrasings": [
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.date.p1",
          "role": "first",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "ご出発は何日ですか？",
          "voice": "Aoede",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.date.p1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.date.p2",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "ご搭乗日はいつでしょうか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.date.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.date.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "何日の便にお乗りになりますか？",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.date.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "哪天出發",
            "zh-Hans": "哪天出发",
            "en": "Which day you leave"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "飛機幾點起飛",
            "zh-Hans": "飞机几点起飞",
            "en": "What time your flight leaves"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要寄幾件",
            "zh-Hans": "要寄几件",
            "en": "How many bags"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "15日です",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.date.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「何日」是幾號，「ご搭乗日」是搭機那天。說日期加「です」，例如「15日です」。寄到機場要提早幾天寄出，截止時間依業者不同，請先確認，以現場說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "「何日」是几号，「ご搭乗日」是登机那天。说日期加「です」，例如「15日です」。寄到机场要提早几天寄出，截止时间依快递公司不同，请先确认，以现场说明为准。",
        "en": "何日 asks which date and ご搭乗日 is the day you fly. Say the date with です, like 15日です. Bags must go out some days before your flight, and the cut-off differs by company, so check early and follow what the staff tell you."
      },
      "wordIds": [],
      "reviewNote": "Cut-off for airport delivery (how many days before the flight) differs by courier and airport; the explanation deliberately gives no number. Confirm the wording."
    },
    {
