          "text": "ご搭乗の便名をお願いします",
          "voice": "Charon",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.flight.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "luggage-delivery.flight.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "航空会社とお便名をお願いします",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "luggage-delivery.flight.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "你的名字是什麼",
            "zh-Hans": "你的名字是什么",
            "en": "What is your name"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "航班編號是多少",
            "zh-Hans": "航班号是多少",
            "en": "What is your flight number"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "飛機幾點起飛",
            "zh-Hans": "飞机几点起飞",
            "en": "What time your flight leaves"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "これです",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.flight.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「便名」是航班編號，例如 BR197，聽起來跟「お名前」很像。可以直接給他看電子機票，說「これです」。",
        "zh-Hans": "「便名」是航班号，例如 BR197，听起来跟「お名前」很像。可以直接给他看电子机票，说「これです」。",
        "en": "便名 is the flight number, like BR197, and it sounds close to お名前. You can just show your e-ticket and say これです."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "boarding-pass"
      ]
    },
    {
